      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANTI VENOM (4) boasts a strong record this journey here with six wins and four minors from 12 tries. In the money last time at this track (20.09) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4 length third. Looks the one to beat with even luck. PSIONIC PROWESS (1) was an effortless winner two back scoring by half a length but could manage only midfield last time when finished 6th and beaten 8 lengths at Q Lakeside (26.05). Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. Expected to give a good account. WINTER WHISKY (7) used the rails draw to advantage to get home last time at Q Straight over 350m (19.11) after being shuffled back early, scoring by a neck. Expected to feature again. KOORINGA TRISH (2) was a surprise last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
